3A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"h-64\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RecentOrders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 推荐内容：依赖 ML 服务，可能 1-3s */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;Skeleton className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"h-96\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Recommendations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#